1	//! The palette: a popover, opened with Ctrl/Cmd+P, for fuzzy searching the
2	//! project's files, the application's own commands, and the harness's
3	//! commands, skills, and agents, each under its own tab. Picking a result
4	//! closes the palette and hands what was picked to the main window.
5	//!
6	//! On the Files tab the search can also be handed to the harness, which looks
7	//! through the project for the file described: Ctrl/Cmd+Enter at any time, or
8	//! Enter when nothing matches. The run's output table takes the place of the
9	//! results while it looks.
10	
11	use std::borrow::Cow;
12	use std::ops::Range;
13	use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};
